  "title": "Datadog US1 - Delayed Traces in APM",
  "text": "Service: Datadog US1\nIncident: Delayed Traces in APM\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: minor\nStarted: 2026-02-11T19:57:47.006-05:00\nResolved: 2026-02-11T21:08:46.715-05:00\nUpdates:\n- 2026-02-11T21:08:46.715-05:00: resolved - This incident has been resolved.\n- 2026-02-11T20:49:18.240-05:00: monitoring - The remaining impact is limited to AWS Streams metrics. We are continuing to monitor for any further issues.\n- 2026-02-11T20:32:45.427-05:00: monitoring - A fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.\n- 2026-02-11T20:20:35.617-05:00: identified - The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.\n- 2026-02-11T19:57:47.140-05:00: investigating - We are investigating increased latency processing Traces in APM Trace Search and AWS streams metrics.\nAs a result of this issue, some users may see missing or delayed traces in APM Trace Search, and delayed AWS stream metrics since 00:13 UTC.",
